emeraldian (0.6.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Build exr at opt-level 1, for reproducibility on arm64. LLVM compiles
    exr's DWA decoder non-deterministically there, which shows up as
    registers assigned differently from build to build; zola 0.23.6-4 works
    around the same function. exr comes in through ratatui-image's
    image-defaults. amd64 was unaffected.

